// Runtime adapter for code generated by the Flick compiler. Generated code
// imports only this package; Effect stays behind it. The package is
// `"sideEffects": false`: loading a module only declares values, and a
// top-level call is marked `/*#__PURE__*/`, so a bundler drops what is unused.
